WEBVTT

00:06.850 --> 00:08.660
Pick up the pace!

00:08.660 --> 00:13.130
If you don't make enough before the war, 
the Emperor will toss you in prison!

00:13.950 --> 00:15.850
Hey! Get your shit together!

00:18.980 --> 00:20.330
Who the hell are you?

00:21.120 --> 00:23.730
I'm from Minato Kai. Asamine Matakara.

00:23.730 --> 00:25.090
I have business with Shindo.

00:25.090 --> 00:26.230
He's from Minato!

00:26.230 --> 00:27.710
You punk!

00:33.450 --> 00:35.430
This is what they're planning?

00:41.800 --> 00:46.280
Welcome, Asamine Matakara-kun 
of the Minato Kai.

00:46.750 --> 00:47.710
Shindo.

00:48.280 --> 00:49.790
I have something to ask you.

00:50.320 --> 00:51.660
What might that be?

00:51.660 --> 00:56.050
Oh, that's right! We're entertaining 
a special guest right now.

00:56.050 --> 00:58.040
Come on, AJ!

00:59.090 --> 01:00.540
You called?

01:03.500 --> 01:04.960
Ara-chan?!

02:35.130 --> 02:40.140
<b>#05 Frightening! Chili Shrimps Falling Down Like Snowflakes!</b>

02:35.890 --> 02:38.260
Ara-chan! What are you doing?

02:39.040 --> 02:41.770
P-Playing king's orders.

02:42.910 --> 02:44.710
Are you guys friends?

02:44.710 --> 02:47.020
No, it's not like that at all!

02:50.020 --> 02:51.780
What the hell are you here for?

02:52.500 --> 02:56.490
Ara-chan, this war between Minato and Siguma

02:56.490 --> 02:58.740
is all a trap that he set up!

02:59.610 --> 03:01.870
I haven't the slightest idea what you mean.

03:02.410 --> 03:04.790
In that case, I'll do this the hard way.

03:04.790 --> 03:07.450
Give it up! Just go, Matakara.

03:07.450 --> 03:09.950
Move it. He's behind everything!

03:10.700 --> 03:13.030
What the hell is going on?

03:14.320 --> 03:17.090
<i>Could that really be him?</i>

03:17.090 --> 03:21.140
All right. Go ahead and ask me...

03:21.810 --> 03:23.950
the hard way.

03:35.360 --> 03:36.740
Yeah, as if.

03:42.500 --> 03:44.560
Good boy.

03:48.370 --> 03:52.800
If you're the number two now, 
Minato must've sunk to a new low.

03:53.470 --> 03:55.670
<i>With kicks like that, there's no mistake.</i>

03:56.370 --> 03:58.390
<i>He must have Ichiya inside him!</i>

04:01.930 --> 04:05.900
Okay, okay.

04:05.900 --> 04:07.830
Today's the day...

04:15.630 --> 04:17.570
Welcome in!

04:17.570 --> 04:20.740
The usual again today?

04:23.810 --> 04:24.890
Jasmine-chan, please.

04:24.890 --> 04:27.330
Okay, extra helping of Jasmine-chan!

04:27.970 --> 04:31.860
U-Um... Would you please cheer up?

04:31.860 --> 04:34.420
Here, a present! It's a choker.

04:34.420 --> 04:37.340
I'm sure it'll look great on you, Jasmine-chan!

04:38.130 --> 04:40.340
Why the hell won't you pick up?

04:40.750 --> 04:42.160
Matakara!

04:57.370 --> 04:58.960
Are you okay?

04:58.960 --> 05:01.270
Why are you hanging out with a guy like that?

05:01.880 --> 05:02.990
Also...

05:03.760 --> 05:05.310
why are you naked?

05:06.060 --> 05:07.490
Well, that's...

05:10.160 --> 05:12.900
Oh, how I remember the pain.

05:16.960 --> 05:21.540
Ew. How is he able to get up?

05:22.500 --> 05:23.840
Come on.

05:23.840 --> 05:24.840
You piece of—

05:24.840 --> 05:25.430
Arajin!

05:25.430 --> 05:28.110
I wanna lose my virginity!

05:31.350 --> 05:34.220
Oh, so you're a cherry boy?

05:34.730 --> 05:36.580
Wh-What's wrong with that?!

05:37.640 --> 05:39.720
Nothing wrong at all.

05:40.070 --> 05:42.610
We all start that way, after all!

06:09.420 --> 06:11.210
Ooh! How cute!

06:12.750 --> 06:14.710
Well, now...

06:15.550 --> 06:17.360
Who's the king?

06:23.110 --> 06:25.770
So I... well...

06:25.770 --> 06:28.130
Yeah, kinda embarrassing.

06:28.130 --> 06:29.370
Shut up!

06:29.370 --> 06:32.510
I-I've got my own reasons, anyway.

06:32.510 --> 06:36.630
But why can't you just drop it? 
Fights like this happen all the time.

06:36.630 --> 06:41.000
A fight that's rigged like this 
isn't a real fight, though!

06:41.000 --> 06:43.970
Huh? What are you talking 
about? "A real fight"?

06:43.970 --> 06:45.470
This is so stupid.

06:45.960 --> 06:47.800
What happened to you?

06:47.800 --> 06:51.360
You were always way more 
into Honki People than I was!

06:51.360 --> 06:53.680
How many times do I have to tell you?

06:53.680 --> 06:56.230
I don't give a damn about Honki People!

06:55.130 --> 06:56.230
Oh?

06:56.590 --> 07:00.360
You two seem to have 
a very special relationship.

07:01.760 --> 07:03.520
Come on, AJ.

07:03.520 --> 07:05.610
Everybody's waiting for you.

07:10.120 --> 07:12.160
Ara-chan, I...

07:12.160 --> 07:14.260
I've always believed in you!

07:14.260 --> 07:15.120
Ara-chan!

07:16.530 --> 07:19.480
What do we have here? Playing superhero?

07:24.520 --> 07:26.010
This is for real!

07:26.010 --> 07:27.720
We're training to become Honki People!

07:27.720 --> 07:31.220
That's so dorky! What the hell 
are Honki People, anyway?

07:31.540 --> 07:32.870
Let's go, man.

07:34.640 --> 07:36.720
Just forget about these guys!

07:36.720 --> 07:39.310
But they're making fun of Honki People!

07:40.810 --> 07:44.300
Well, you are "for real" a total dumbass, kid.

07:44.300 --> 07:45.190
Matakara!

08:02.780 --> 08:04.040
Matakara...

08:04.780 --> 08:07.720
That's cold, man. 
Just throw your pal under the bus?

08:08.420 --> 08:12.350
But I can't... I can't do anything!

08:12.610 --> 08:14.260
Next...

08:14.970 --> 08:16.780
It's your turn!

08:19.590 --> 08:21.360
He ran away!

08:25.080 --> 08:27.980
<i>Quit reminding me of shit like that!</i>

08:40.250 --> 08:42.270
So they showed up.

08:42.270 --> 08:45.720
We'll take those Minato scum and 
slaughter the whole lot of them!

08:50.630 --> 08:55.690
<i>Once he finishes off that triple-fundoshi
 gorilla, Brother will graduate Siguma,</i>

08:55.690 --> 08:57.370
<i>and then he'll be all mine!</i>

08:57.370 --> 08:59.020
<i>But he did get really hurt before.</i>

08:59.020 --> 09:03.020
Jeez! What happened to that stone 
pervert guy and his blockhead friend?

09:17.040 --> 09:20.840
Everyone, we have a special guest! This is AJ!

09:20.840 --> 09:22.120
Glad to be here!

09:22.120 --> 09:23.660
Yay!

09:22.120 --> 09:23.660
Hooray!

09:23.660 --> 09:24.540
AJ!

09:24.540 --> 09:27.200
AJ is actually in Siguma right now,

09:27.200 --> 09:29.800
but he says he doesn't vibe with them at all!

09:29.800 --> 09:33.520
And of course he doesn't! 
The head of their gang is nonsense!

09:33.520 --> 09:37.010
He's a super lame, rotten freak, am I right?

09:37.010 --> 09:38.280
He's nonsense!

09:38.280 --> 09:40.020
Lame and rotten!

09:40.490 --> 09:42.020
That all you got?

09:42.020 --> 09:43.240
Lame piece of shit!

09:43.240 --> 09:44.830
Frickin' nonsense!

09:44.830 --> 09:46.270
Rotten chickenshit asshole!

09:46.270 --> 09:48.340
Okay, okay.

09:48.700 --> 09:51.170
So dump that Siguma trash and come join us.

09:51.170 --> 09:58.160
Uh, I guess I do want to learn 
a little more about NG! Yeah...

09:56.720 --> 09:58.160
Hi!

09:58.500 --> 10:02.390
Well, listen up, then. 
E-4 is the motto we go by here.

10:02.390 --> 10:04.790
Huh... Meaning?

10:04.790 --> 10:06.290
Energy!

10:06.290 --> 10:07.790
Enjoy!

10:09.380 --> 10:11.540
Ecstasy!

10:12.190 --> 10:13.550
Hey, say it!

10:13.550 --> 10:16.480
Emperor!

10:16.710 --> 10:18.180
Emperor!

10:18.180 --> 10:20.180
<i>This is so dumb!</i>

10:20.180 --> 10:21.630
Well, then.

10:22.160 --> 10:26.830
The final battle between Minato 
and Siguma is about to begin,

10:26.830 --> 10:29.790
so I want you all to murder out there.

10:29.790 --> 10:31.190
If you don't,

10:31.630 --> 10:34.070
it'll be me murdering you instead.

10:34.070 --> 10:38.080
Murder them! Murder them!

10:38.080 --> 10:47.290
Murder them! Murder them!

10:38.620 --> 10:40.940
These guys don't seem right.

10:40.940 --> 10:44.830
Hmph. A fight isn't something 
you do because you're told to.

10:44.830 --> 10:46.810
Do you even hear yourself?

10:50.050 --> 10:52.020
It's just about time.

10:52.580 --> 10:53.690
Shall we go?

10:54.300 --> 10:56.550
Um, but where to?

10:56.550 --> 10:58.250
What did I just say?

10:58.250 --> 11:03.620
When Minato and Siguma meet to take each 
other out, we're gonna round them all up and...

11:08.310 --> 11:10.330
finish them off.

11:11.250 --> 11:14.320
So it is just like Matakara said.

11:20.200 --> 11:22.500
Ara-chan! Ara-chan!

11:28.610 --> 11:31.810
<i>Ara-chan, have you actually</i>

11:31.810 --> 11:34.800
<i>completely given up on 
becoming Honki People?</i>

11:44.180 --> 11:47.480
<b>Ma</b>

11:44.180 --> 11:47.480
<b>Ara</b>

11:44.180 --> 11:47.480
<b>Jin</b>

11:44.180 --> 11:47.480
<b>Takara</b>

11:45.810 --> 11:47.480
It's a best friend stone!

11:48.100 --> 11:50.300
Let's become Honki People together!

11:51.790 --> 11:53.240
<i>That's right.</i>

11:53.240 --> 11:56.610
<i>There's no way Ara-chan would 
give up on his dream to be Honki.</i>

11:57.750 --> 11:59.680
<i>That's not who he is!</i>

12:05.330 --> 12:06.750
Matakara...

12:06.750 --> 12:08.840
It's almost time!

12:08.840 --> 12:11.590
They're gonna pay for what they did!

12:12.310 --> 12:15.100
Hey, Zabu? Where the hell are you going?

12:20.470 --> 12:23.550
Today, we finally settle the score,

12:25.660 --> 12:27.480
Kenichiro.

12:27.480 --> 12:29.480
Marito-kun! Let him have it!

12:29.480 --> 12:30.660
Yeah!

12:29.480 --> 12:32.370
What is that? What <i>is</i> that body?!

12:30.660 --> 12:32.370
That's right!

12:32.370 --> 12:34.980
A god? Is my brother actually a god?!

12:38.850 --> 12:44.730
When you were talking to Matakara-kun 
earlier, he said something about Honki People.

12:44.730 --> 12:47.700
Yeah, it's how we used to play as kids.

12:50.710 --> 12:55.210
But he still hasn't grown out of it.

12:55.910 --> 12:57.980
What a pain in the ass.

12:58.720 --> 13:01.160
Have you visited Honki Shrine recently?

13:01.160 --> 13:01.940
Huh?

13:02.300 --> 13:04.010
Tell him you haven't.

13:05.630 --> 13:07.550
I don't think so.

13:08.340 --> 13:09.390
Oh.

13:11.940 --> 13:15.220
I'm really starting to feel 
like we're gonna get along.

13:17.780 --> 13:18.610
Huh?

13:19.280 --> 13:22.150
I want to make you my right-hand man.

13:22.150 --> 13:23.740
So join me.

13:25.530 --> 13:28.520
Yeah, that's way too much 
responsibility for me!

13:28.520 --> 13:31.370
And those guys all have that 
weird look in their eyes.

13:31.370 --> 13:35.630
You might end up toasting your cherry
goodbye with the NG Girls, though.

13:49.160 --> 13:50.600
Pow!

13:52.300 --> 13:55.060
Ah, I can't make up my mind!

13:55.060 --> 13:58.200
AJ, you can have everything you want!

13:58.760 --> 14:00.110
Everything?

14:00.110 --> 14:05.120
Yeah! You have to do whatever 
it takes to get what you want.

14:05.670 --> 14:08.680
Just like I'm going to get 
everything I want today.

14:10.140 --> 14:13.500
Minato and Siguma... and then...

14:14.190 --> 14:17.980
Kenichiro! I'm going to crush them all!

14:19.130 --> 14:22.990
Um, do you mind if I ask why?

14:22.990 --> 14:25.900
Why don't you just leave those guys alone?

14:41.900 --> 14:45.410
<b>Minato Kai</b>

15:02.370 --> 15:05.630
Senpai, you're too stubborn.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.390
The fight is over.

15:07.390 --> 15:08.790
No, it's not.

15:09.250 --> 15:11.600
You haven't won the fight yet!

15:15.260 --> 15:18.520
Your kicks are too weak.

15:21.490 --> 15:23.670
I said back off already!

15:35.550 --> 15:36.820
What is this?

15:37.550 --> 15:41.560
I won, didn't I? I'm the one who won!

15:41.560 --> 15:43.460
Isn't that right, Ken-san?

15:43.850 --> 15:44.840
Ken-san?

15:45.320 --> 15:46.420
Wait...

15:46.970 --> 15:48.590
Wait! Hey!

15:48.590 --> 15:50.310
Turn and face me!

15:50.920 --> 15:53.350
Kenichiro!

16:00.330 --> 16:01.460
I am the one.

16:01.460 --> 16:04.710
I am the one who will bring 
Kenichiro to his knees.

16:05.540 --> 16:08.130
And I decided that if anyone gets in my way,

16:08.970 --> 16:12.300
no matter who they are, I will kill them.

16:12.620 --> 16:16.310
Wow, you sure do hold a grudge.

16:16.670 --> 16:19.120
Let's just say that I'm dedicated.

16:19.510 --> 16:22.380
But aren't you and I alike that way?

16:22.380 --> 16:23.640
Huh?

16:23.640 --> 16:26.450
I think I'm more of a pacifist.

16:26.450 --> 16:29.510
So this type of deal 
isn't my thing, you know?

16:30.030 --> 16:32.650
But you still want to say 
"cherry, goodbye." Don't you?

16:33.630 --> 16:36.520
Well, that is true.

16:38.180 --> 16:43.590
You know, what all girls 
really want is a strong man.

16:44.230 --> 16:46.020
AJ!

16:46.770 --> 16:48.220
Heart!

16:49.970 --> 16:54.990
Then I'll show them what true 
manly strength looks like.

16:59.000 --> 17:01.560
Come on, Zabu! What is that bozo doing?

17:01.560 --> 17:03.130
It's about to start!

17:14.100 --> 17:15.090
Now that's a man!

17:15.090 --> 17:16.110
Ken-san. I love you, man.

17:16.110 --> 17:17.320
A man among men.

17:17.320 --> 17:18.760
I'm getting chills!

17:17.660 --> 17:22.100
If Brother fights that thing, 
he'll be broken in half!

17:22.820 --> 17:24.700
What the heck are those guys doing?

17:24.700 --> 17:27.610
Hurry up, stone perv! Blockhead!

17:28.510 --> 17:29.940
You asked for it, you—

17:30.770 --> 17:32.860
This is Zabu Kakeru from Minato Kai!

17:33.250 --> 17:35.340
Matakara? You here?

17:38.880 --> 17:40.160
Just in time!

17:40.160 --> 17:41.620
Are you okay?

17:41.620 --> 17:45.380
You have to hurry. 
Shindo is headed to the Coliseum!

17:49.130 --> 17:52.570
So, shall we let them snuff each other out?

17:53.380 --> 17:57.170
Murder them! Murder them!

17:57.170 --> 18:02.140
Murder them! Murder them!

18:02.140 --> 18:08.040
Murder them! Murder them!

18:02.490 --> 18:05.430
It's so damn pathetic 
that they need weapons.

18:05.430 --> 18:09.150
Where the hell is their manly pride? Right?

18:09.150 --> 18:11.500
Hey. Where do you think you're going?

18:12.220 --> 18:16.060
Well, you know. 
To lose my virginity, you know?

18:16.060 --> 18:18.160
I don't wanna get stuck in some stupid war!

18:18.160 --> 18:22.250
Huh?! But if you get into it here, 
our merge rate will go through the roof!

18:22.250 --> 18:23.640
Don't you chicken out!

18:24.480 --> 18:26.530
Impossible!

18:25.180 --> 18:26.530
Hey!

18:27.000 --> 18:29.160
Where are you off to, AJ?

18:29.160 --> 18:32.130
Um, to the toilet.

18:32.480 --> 18:34.870
It seems you're still conflicted.

18:34.870 --> 18:38.640
Once we crush Siguma, 
that babe will be ours, you know.

18:38.640 --> 18:40.540
That babe?

18:41.700 --> 18:45.150
Jin Marito has a little sister 
named Mahoro, you see.

18:45.150 --> 18:47.410
She's a real cutie.

18:47.410 --> 18:50.900
Well, not really my type, though.

18:54.650 --> 18:55.850
<i>What the...</i>

18:56.910 --> 19:01.350
But she has a nice face, at least. Maybe we 
could put that bird on display, you know?

19:01.870 --> 19:03.180
On display?

19:05.560 --> 19:06.900
My body...

19:07.420 --> 19:12.110
Wouldn't it be a great look if I kept their 
boss's little sister around to service me?

19:12.500 --> 19:14.420
What do they call that, a trophy girl?

19:15.930 --> 19:18.050
<i>I-I'm hot!</i>

19:18.050 --> 19:22.560
You know, AJ, I could even 
pass her to you once in a while.

19:29.560 --> 19:32.320
Heave!

19:40.330 --> 19:41.330
Huh?

19:41.330 --> 19:43.170
What the hell was that?

19:46.080 --> 19:47.960
I'm gonna blow!

19:55.100 --> 19:56.830
<i>There's no mistake.</i>

19:56.830 --> 20:00.350
<i>He's got Senya inside him!</i>

20:06.810 --> 20:08.970
You Siguma trash!

20:08.970 --> 20:11.270
We're gonna wipe the floor with you!

20:11.270 --> 20:14.780
Nothing can stop me from 
getting revenge for Outa-kun!

20:46.950 --> 20:49.350
Guys! Listen to me!

20:49.800 --> 20:51.030
This is a setup!

20:51.910 --> 20:54.360
Shindo Akutaro from NG 
set this whole thing up!

20:56.110 --> 20:56.990
Yeah, right!

20:56.990 --> 20:58.260
Shut the hell up!

20:58.260 --> 21:01.110
Quit screwing with us!

21:01.420 --> 21:06.130
The Minato armband that was... 
found next to Outa-kun...

21:06.130 --> 21:09.960
It was mine! Shindo stole it from me!

21:10.720 --> 21:12.000
I'm so sorry!

21:12.000 --> 21:12.710
Huh?

21:12.710 --> 21:13.600
Quit talking shit!

21:13.600 --> 21:15.250
What's NG got to do with anything?

21:16.650 --> 21:17.760
Ken-san!

21:22.720 --> 21:23.870
Matakara!

21:29.350 --> 21:30.770
Ara-chan?

21:30.770 --> 21:32.750
What a great haul!

21:32.750 --> 21:35.480
Let's beat these guys up! Hey!

21:36.050 --> 21:37.230
Ara-chan!

21:37.980 --> 21:39.800
You actually came!

21:40.430 --> 21:43.170
Why hasn't anything started yet?!

21:43.170 --> 21:44.120
Damn it!

21:44.120 --> 21:45.620
It's the NG!

21:45.620 --> 21:47.490
What is going on?

21:48.000 --> 21:50.980
Ken-san, please stop this war!

21:51.520 --> 21:55.750
None of that matters anymore.

21:56.510 --> 21:58.880
Does it, Kenichiro?

22:00.350 --> 22:01.710
Oh, no...

22:05.260 --> 22:05.820
<b>Minato Kai</b>

23:45.030 --> 23:50.870
<b>"Nira-Reba"-lution 21!</b>

23:45.030 --> 23:50.870
<b>Much Much Friendship!</b>

23:45.870 --> 23:47.940
Bucchigi-you again next week!
